"home.trapsBody": "<ul class=\"progresshint\" style=\"line-height:1.7\"><li><b>Who sets which bit:</b> CPU/MMU <i>sets</i> reference &amp; dirty bits; the <b>OS</b> clears the reference bit (Clock) &amp; sets present/valid.</li><li><b>Critical-section conditions:</b> Mutual Exclusion / Progress / Bounded Waiting. \"Starvation\" is a <i>consequence</i>, not a condition.</li><li><b>Scheduling identity:</b> RR(quantum=∞)=FCFS; SJF=non-preemptive, SRTF=preemptive.</li></ul>",
